# The home screen with no SD card, a card put in, and the card pulled out.
# Run: --boot off --fps 30 --frames 270
#
# 0: the slot is empty from the start (the same picture as --no-card)
0 card out
# 0-39: NO CARD, INSERT A CARD TO SEE GAMES
40 card in
# The console looks at the slot every 2 seconds: at frame 60 it finds the
# card, shows the fourteen tiles and a green CARD READY note (until about 142)
100 card out
# At the next look (frame 120) the row is gone: NO CARD again. The red
# CARD REMOVED note waits for CARD READY to go up, then slides down
# (until about 225).
